###
### Get businesses near influencer (default radius 50km)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get businesses near influencer with custom radius (25km)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?radius_km=25
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get businesses near influencer with larger radius (100km)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?radius_km=100
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get businesses near influencer filtered by industry
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?industry_filter=restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get businesses near influencer filtered by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?industry_filter=retail
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get only verified businesses from database
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?verified_only=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get database businesses only (exclude external MCP search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?include_external=false
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get external businesses only (MCP search results)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?verified_only=false&include_external=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get businesses with multiple filters combined
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?radius_km=30&industry_filter=hospitality&verified_only=true&include_external=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get businesses near influencer with very small radius (5km)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?radius_km=5
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get businesses near influencer with very large radius (500km - max)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?radius_km=500
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Get businesses near influencer 2 (different location)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/2/businesses-nearby
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Error test: Invalid radius (too small)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?radius_km=0.5
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Error test: Invalid radius (too large)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby?radius_km=600
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Error test: Non-existent influencer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/99999/businesses-nearby
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Error test: Without authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/influencers/1/businesses-nearby
Content-Type: application/json

###
### Documentation Note:
# The response includes:
# - database_businesses: Array of businesses from our database with details like:
#   * id, name, contact info (email, phone, website)
#   * location details (latitude, longitude, city, country, region)
#   * business info (industry, category, rating, verified status)
#   * distance_km from influencer's location
#   * source: "database"
#
# - external_businesses: Array of businesses from MCP search with details like:
#   * name, website_url, phone, address
#   * location details (city, country, latitude, longitude)
#   * description, category, rating, review_count
#   * relevance_score from search
#   * source: "mcp_search" or "duckduckgo"
#
# - search_location: Formatted location string
# - total_results: Total count of all results
# - db_count: Count of database results
# - external_count: Count of external search results

